{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And the earth was tohu and bohu.</b> That earth which was created then was a composite of first matter, called tohu, and of first form, called bohu. For indeed it was not fitting for first matter to be without any form; that form was necessarily the first of all the forms of composites. From this it is clear that first matter is something created. And the matter of that first composite is called tohu because, considered in itself, it is merely a potential thing, not existing in actuality — as it says: כִּי תֹהוּ הֵמָּה (1 Samuel 12:21), that is, not existing in actuality but in imagination alone. And the form borne in that first composite is called bohu, because in it — in the tohu just mentioned — there is existence in actuality. And he calls אַבְנֵי בֹהוּ (Isaiah 34:11) that which bears a form but does not endure with it for any appreciable time — as happened to the bearer of the first form, which immediately took on successive elemental forms." "<b>And darkness.</b> This is the dark air that was then emanated from the first composite, <b>upon the face of the deep</b> — upon the face of the two lower elements that were also then emanated from the first composite, and they surrounded one another." "<b>And the ruach of Elohim.</b> The movers of the sphere, which are called ruach, as it says: עוֹשֶׂה מַלְאָכָיו רוּחוֹת (Psalms 104:4)." "<b>Hovering over the face of the waters.</b> They then moved the dark air over the face of the waters that then surrounded the element of earth. And so it happened that the part of it nearest the sphere became inflamed through its motion — and this is the elemental fire — while the part of it near the waters then acquired a certain coldness from the waters, except for a small portion of it that is heated incidentally when sparks from the luminaries of light are reflected."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:07.659381889Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}